---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
---
<Base
  title="Approach | Mission Vision Strategy"
  description="How Mission Vision Strategy works: mission, vision, strategy, and follow-through."
  current="approach"
  contactHeading="Ready to get clear?"
  contactText="Tell us about your organization and what you're working toward."
>
    <section class="hero page-hero">
      <div class="wrap">
        <p class="eyebrow"><img class="star" src="/images/star.svg" alt="">Approach</p>
        <h1>Mission. Vision. Strategy.</h1>
        <p class="lede">The name is the method. We start with why you exist, agree on where
          you're going, and then build the path between the two.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="skyline"></div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="wrap">
        <ol class="steps">
          <li>
            <h2>Mission: understand where you stand</h2>
            <p>We listen first. Interviews, listening sessions, and a close look at your data,
              governance, and operations show how the organization really works today, and
              whether that still serves the people you exist for.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h2>Vision: agree on where you're going</h2>
            <p>With your board, leadership, and staff, we turn what we've learned into a
              shared picture of success: clear priorities, honest trade-offs, and goals you
              can measure.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h2>Strategy: build the path</h2>
            <p>We design the structures, workflows, and plans that connect today to that
              vision, specific enough that your team knows what to do on Monday.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h2>Follow-through: make it stick</h2>
            <p>Plans fail in the handoff. We stay involved through implementation, equip your
              team with frameworks they can keep running, and check in on progress.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section section-warm">
      <div class="wrap split">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow"><img class="star" src="/images/star.svg" alt="">What to expect</p>
          <h2>Grounded, collaborative, and practical.</h2>
          <p>We work alongside your team rather than disappearing to write a report. You'll
            hear from us often, see work in progress, and end with recommendations your people
            helped shape.</p>
        </div>
        <blockquote class="quote">
          <p>&ldquo;Make no little plans.&rdquo;</p>
          <cite>Daniel Burnham, architect of the 1909 Plan of Chicago</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </section>

</Base>
